# Vercel CLI (robert-4220 only)

Pavilion deploys: `commons-pto-demo`, `commons-pto`, `commons-site`. Never treasurer / Stone Hill www.

Before any `vercel` command in this workspace:

```bash
./scripts/with-vercel-env.sh vercel … --scope robert-4220s-projects
```

Requires local `.env.vercel` (copy from `.env.vercel.example`). Never commit tokens.

Do **not** `vercel link` or deploy to treasurer. Stone Hill ships from `~/shmspto` via git push only.
